      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk2_sc047_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "这个周末我们几个人准备去走一条新路线，你有兴趣吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc047_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "听起来不错。有多少人？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc047_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "大概五六个，都是我认识的朋友。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc047_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我都不认识，会不会有点儿奇怪？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc047_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "不会，大家都很随和。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc047_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "路线难吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc047_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "不难，两个小时左右，中间会休息。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc047_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我应该没问题。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc047_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "你只要穿舒服的鞋，带水就行。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc047_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "几点集合？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc047_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "上午九点，在公园东门。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc047_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我可以直接过去。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc047_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "好。我会提前告诉他们有新朋友来。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc047_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "谢谢，这样我会轻松一点儿。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc047_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "不用担心，不需要特别准备聊天内容。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc047_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我现在比以前自然多了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc047_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_CHEN_YU_001",
      "textZh": "那周末正好再练练。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc047_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，我参加。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
